    narr:generatedFrom "9c2744b4b0da61c95480afdc9a39c0b0a90f14e1" ;
    narr:narration """Scarlet Dame's voice on this date is an architect's: the session's through-line is how the knowledge graph should be navigated, expanded, and queried. She argues for [tightly controlling the unit of expand so a position is never returned alone](narr:Expr_20261014_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2b4e6ba9fb14_7), sketches a [multi-tiered actor hub linking calls, narratives, and positions one level down](narr:Expr_20261014_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2b4e6ba9fb14_6), and proposes [frame-based indexing as a name for the approach](narr:Expr_20261014_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2b4e6ba9fb14_19). She holds that [a frame is not the carrier of meaning — the frame through which statements are read produces it](narr:Expr_20261014_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2b4e6ba9fb14_25), and that [statements out of strata context lose their direction](narr:Expr_20261014_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2b4e6ba9fb14_23). She wants [full navigational fidelity when viewing a document](narr:Expr_20261014_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2b4e6ba9fb14_10) and warns against [dumping navigation to file](narr:Expr_20261014_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2b4e6ba9fb14_12). A second thread is process discipline: [slowing down on the 766 ruling before passing it to other sessions](narr:Expr_20261014_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2b4e6ba9fb14_4), [separating steering from recall in the query engine](narr:Expr_20261014_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2b4e6ba9fb14_46), and [distrust of rolling a new query engine by accident](narr:Expr_20261014_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2b4e6ba9fb14_47). She closes on [a standing-on-the-shoulders-of-giants ethic over cowboyism](narr:Expr_20261014_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2b4e6ba9fb14_50).""" ;
